### 6.4 Get Supplier by ID
# Use Case: View vendor profile and contact points.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 6.5 Update Supplier (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Update vendor billing address, dispatch email, or phone.
PUT {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "name": "Cisco Systems Enterprise Division",
  "email": "enterprise-sales@cisco.com",
  "phone": "+1-800-553-0000",
  "address": "170 West Tasman Dr, Bldg 10, San Jose, CA 95134"
}


### 6.6 Delete Supplier (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Remove supplier record if no historical purchase orders exist.
DELETE {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 7. CUSTOMERS
### ===================================================================

### 7.1 Get All Customers
# Use Case: List client accounts for sales order dispatch.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 7.2 Search Customers by Term
# Use Case: Search client base by business name, email, or phone.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/customers/search?term=Acme
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 7.3 Create Customer (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Register a new wholesale/retail customer account.
# @name createCustomer
POST {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "name": "Omega Tech Solutions LLC",
  "email": "procurement@omegatech.io",
  "phone": "+1-415-555-0143",
  "address": "500 Howard St, Suite 300, San Francisco, CA 94105"
}

### Store Customer ID
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.id}}


### 7.4 Get Customer by ID
# Use Case: Fetch client address and details.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 7.5 Update Customer (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Update customer delivery destination or contact representative.
PUT {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "name": "Omega Tech Solutions Inc.",
