### ===================================================================
### 8. PRODUCTS CATALOG
### ===================================================================

### 8.1 Get All Products
# Use Case: List master product catalog (includeInactive=true shows decommissioned SKUs).
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products?includeInactive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 8.2 Search Products by Keyword
# Use Case: Search products by SKU or Name substring (e.g. 'Dell', 'Switch', 'Router').
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?term=Dell
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 8.3 Get Products by Category
# Use Case: Filter catalog items by their specific category ID.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products/category/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 8.4 Create Product (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Introduce a new item SKU into the catalog with pricing and reorder threshold.
# @name createProduct
POST {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "name": "Cisco Catalyst 9300 48-Port Switch",
  "sku": "CSCO-CAT9300-48P",
  "description": "Layer 3 managed gigabit PoE+ enterprise switch",
  "purchasePrice": 2200.00,
  "sellingPrice": 3450.00,
  "reorderLevel": 5,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Store Product ID
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}


### 8.5 Get Product by ID
# Use Case: Query detailed specs, pricing, and reorder point of a product.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 8.6 Update Product (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Adjust selling/purchase prices, reorder thresholds, or descriptions (SKU is immutable).
PUT {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "name": "Cisco Catalyst 9300 48-Port Switch (PoE+)",
  "description": "Enterprise Layer 3 switch with redundant power supply",
  "purchasePrice": 2250.00,
  "sellingPrice": 3500.00,
  "reorderLevel": 8,
  "categoryId": 1
}


### 8.7 Deactivate Product (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Discontinue an item so it cannot be added to new orders.
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 8.8 Reactivate Product (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Restore an archived product back to active selling catalog.
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 9. WAREHOUSE STOCKS & INVENTORY VISIBILITY
### ===================================================================

### 9.1 Query Filtered Warehouse Stocks
# Use Case: Multi-criteria stock query across warehouses and products (excludeZero=true hides 0 balances).
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousestocks?warehouseId=1&productId=1&excludeZero=false
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 9.2 Get Stock Breakdown by Warehouse
# Use Case: View complete on-hand inventory levels stored inside a specific warehouse.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousestocks/warehouse/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 9.3 Get Stock Distribution for a Product Across All Warehouses
# Use Case: See how a single product's inventory is distributed across all facilities.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousestocks/product/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 9.4 Get Total On-Hand Aggregated Count
# Use Case: Get company-wide total units on hand for an SKU (sum across all warehouses).
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousestocks/product/1/total-on-hand
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 9.5 Get Low Stock Alert Items
# Use Case: Trigger replenishment report: lists all products where total stock <= ReorderLevel.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/warehousestocks/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 10. STOCK TRANSACTIONS & ADJUSTMENTS (AUDIT TRAIL)
### ===================================================================

### 10.1 Get Stock Transaction History for a Product
# Use Case: Full audit ledger of all ins, outs, adjustments, and transfers for a product.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransactions/product/1?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 10.2 Get Stock Transaction History for a Warehouse
# Use Case: Comprehensive movement log of every event that occurred in a warehouse.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransactions/warehouse/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 10.3 Get Stock Transactions by Date Range
# Use Case: Audit ledger filtering for financial month-end reconciliations.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransactions/date-range?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 10.4 Record Manual Stock Adjustment
# Use Case: Physical stocktake reconciliation (+ positive to increment, - negative to decrement).
POST {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransactions/adjustment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 3,
  "reason": "Annual physical count: found 3 unrecorded units on aisle 4"
}


### ===================================================================
### 11. PURCHASE ORDER WORKFLOW (Procurement & Receiving)
### ===================================================================

### 11.1 Get All Purchase Orders
# Use Case: Overview list of all vendor POs with their statuses and totals.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.2 Filter Purchase Orders by Supplier
# Use Case: View orders placed with a specific vendor.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/supplier/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.3 Filter Purchase Orders by Destination Warehouse
# Use Case: Warehouse managers tracking inward inbound freight for their facility.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/warehouse/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.4 Filter Purchase Orders by Status
# Use Case: Find all POs in a specific state (Draft, Submitted, Received, Cancelled).
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/status/Draft
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.5 Create Purchase Order (Draft)
# Use Case: Staff creates a new Draft purchase order for goods to be delivered to WH-MAIN.
# @name createPurchaseOrder
POST {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 15,
      "unitPrice": 850.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 30,
      "unitPrice": 50.00
    }
  ]
}

### Store PO ID
@poId = {{createPurchaseOrder.response.body.id}}


### 11.6 Get Purchase Order by ID
# Use Case: Inspect detailed line items, unit costs, and current status of a PO.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/{{poId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.7 Update Purchase Order (While in Draft)
# Use Case: Adjust line items, quantities, or destination before submitting to vendor.
PUT {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/{{poId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 1,
  "orderDate": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 20,
      "unitPrice": 840.00
    }
  ]
}


### 11.8 Submit Purchase Order
# Use Case: Change status from Draft -> Submitted (locks order for vendor dispatch).
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/{{poId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.9 Receive Purchase Order (Stock Ingestion)
# Use Case: Delivery dock receiving: Automatically increments on-hand stock in destination warehouse
#           and records audit transaction in the ledger!
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/{{poId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 11.10 Cancel Purchase Order (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Abort/Cancel a draft or submitted PO that vendor cannot fulfill.
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/{{poId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 12. SALES ORDER WORKFLOW (Order Placement & Fulfillment)
### ===================================================================

### 12.1 Get All Sales Orders
# Use Case: Review customer order backlog and shipment states.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.2 Filter Sales Orders by Customer
# Use Case: View complete order history for a client account.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/customer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.3 Filter Sales Orders by Source Warehouse
# Use Case: Review fulfillment demand originating from a specific warehouse.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/warehouse/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.4 Filter Sales Orders by Status
# Use Case: Find sales orders by workflow state (Draft, Submitted, Shipped, Cancelled).
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/status/Draft
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.5 Create Sales Order (Draft)
# Use Case: Record a customer sales order in Draft status.
# @name createSalesOrder
POST {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 1250.00
    }
  ]
}

### Store Sales Order ID
@soId = {{createSalesOrder.response.body.id}}


### 12.6 Get Sales Order by ID
# Use Case: View customer shipping information, itemized lines, and fulfillment progress.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/{{soId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.7 Update Sales Order (While in Draft)
# Use Case: Modify quantities or pricing before submitting for warehouse pick & pack.
PUT {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/{{soId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "orderDate": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1250.00
    }
  ]
}


### 12.8 Submit Sales Order
# Use Case: Confirm customer order and queue it for warehouse picking (Draft -> Submitted).
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/{{soId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.9 Ship Sales Order (Stock Deduction & Dispatch)
# Use Case: Warehouse marks order as Shipped: Checks stock availability, deducts on-hand units,
#           and writes transaction record into the inventory ledger!
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/{{soId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 12.10 Cancel Sales Order (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Cancel order on customer request (only allowed prior to shipping).
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/salesorders/{{soId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 13. STOCK TRANSFERS (Inter-Warehouse Relocation)
### ===================================================================

### 13.1 Get All Stock Transfers
# Use Case: Review internal transfer log between regional facilities.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.2 Filter Stock Transfers by Source Warehouse
# Use Case: Track outward outbound relocations originating from a warehouse.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/source/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.3 Filter Stock Transfers by Destination Warehouse
# Use Case: Track inbound transfers expected to arrive at a warehouse.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/destination/2
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.4 Filter Stock Transfers by Status
# Use Case: Filter transfers by status (Draft, Pending, Approved, Completed, Cancelled).
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/status/Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.5 Create Stock Transfer (Draft)
# Use Case: Staff creates a transfer request from WH-MAIN (1) to WH-EAST (2).
# @name createTransfer
POST {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 2,
  "notes": "Transfer 5 laptop units to cover seasonal demand in East region",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 5
    }
  ]
}

### Store Transfer ID
@transferId = {{createTransfer.response.body.id}}


### 13.6 Get Stock Transfer by ID
# Use Case: View transfer manifest, item quantities, and authorization timestamps.
GET {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/{{transferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.7 Update Stock Transfer (While in Draft)
# Use Case: Edit quantity or add/remove products prior to submitting for authorization.
PUT {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/{{transferId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "sourceWarehouseId": 1,
  "destinationWarehouseId": 2,
  "transferDate": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Adjusted transfer count: 3 units needed instead of 5",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}


### 13.8 Submit Stock Transfer for Approval
# Use Case: Status moves Draft -> Pending. Awaiting manager approval (Segregation of Duties).
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/{{transferId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.9 Approve Stock Transfer (Manager / Admin Only)
# Use Case: Manager approves the relocation after validating operational need (Pending -> Approved).
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/{{transferId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 13.10 Complete Stock Transfer (Fulfillment & Balanced Stock Adjustment)
# Use Case: Receiving dock confirms arrival: Automatically decrements Source warehouse stock
#           and increments Destination warehouse stock with linked audit entries!
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/{{transferId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### 13.11 Cancel Stock Transfer (Admin / Manager)
# Use Case: Cancel transfer before dispatch (available in Draft, Pending, or Approved states).
PATCH {{IMS_API_HostAddress}}/api/stocktransfers/{{transferId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
